.TH proc_sys_fs_inotify 5 (date) "Linux man-pages (unreleased)"
.SH NAME
/proc/sys/fs/inotify/ \- kernel variables related to inotify
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I /proc/sys/fs/inotify/
.SH DESCRIPTION
.TP
.IR /proc/sys/fs/inotify/ " (since Linux 2.6.13)"
This directory contains files
.IR max_queued_events ", " max_user_instances ", and " max_user_watches ,
that can be used to limit the amount of kernel memory consumed by the
.I inotify
interface.
For further details, see
.BR inotify (7).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR proc_sys_fs (5)
